Hello,

I would like to announce my candidacy for Adjutant PTL for the 2027.1 cycle.

I have served as the PTL for the first time in the 2026.2 cycle. During this
cycle we have started working on maintainability improvements such as
bringing the Adjutant repositories up to date with the latest Python
packaging standards, and introducing DevStack plugins for Adjutant and
Adjutant UI. We have also started working in earnest on new features
such as adding support for quota management of more OpenStack services
and Keystone user group management.

For the 2027.1 cycle we intend to continue this work to ensure these
new features can be landed successfully, and generally continue to keep
Adjutant up to date for clouds using it. I would appreciate the opportunity
to continue to lead these efforts as PTL.

Thank you for your consideration,

Callum Dickinson
Catalyst Cloud
